{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aSunken Dragon\u300bis a retro-style, turn-based Japanese RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring nostalgic pixel art paired with modernized controls, you\u2019ll guide the protagonist on a journey through this fantastical world. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet comrades who share your goals and form a party to adventure together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 characters in battle simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, branching storylines with extensive hidden content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of main-story gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast world map filled with diverse villages and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable movement and battle speeds\u2014set your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of equipment and extended character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit\u2013style graphics and soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257760?t=1769153577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257760?t=1769153577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257760/a0f14d3613f01e08461862b9ec5dbf3a917aa195/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769153577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257760/a0f14d3613f01e08461862b9ec5dbf3a917aa195/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769153577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contr